# Logfire project write token.
#
# NOT needed for local development: the SDK reads
# .logfire/logfire_credentials.json automatically.
#
# Needed in CI, containers, and deployed environments, where no
# credentials file exists.
#
# WARNING: nothing loads this file automatically. Neither the app nor
# 'uv run uvicorn app.main:app' reads .env. Either inject the variable
# directly, or pass --env-file .env to uvicorn. Otherwise LOGFIRE_TOKEN
# stays unset and telemetry silently degrades to local-only.
#
# .env is gitignored. Never commit a real token.
LOGFIRE_TOKEN=
